     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Dear Eric\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Thank you for your reply. The person in GitHub with abrah15 was me. I did the same procedure but the same error keeps happening.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Dec 13, 2023, 19:48 Eric Rexstad &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>Eric.R...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Greetings Abraham.</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Sorry to hear about your error running Distance for Windows. You have pointed to the correct Github issue and advice for\r\n solving the problem. I note with curiosity that a person with identifier &quot;abrah15&quot; was a correspondent on that Github issue and\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185#issuecomment-455866010\" title=\"https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185#issuecomment-455866010\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185%23issuecomment-455866010&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471958783000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LGFvd4LtHpCHUkM9zWUCo\">\r\nindicated in January of 2019</a> they were able to solve the problem. Was that you Abraham?<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\" style=\"border-spacing:0px\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:120px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185#issuecomment-455866010\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185%23issuecomment-455866010&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471958783000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LGFvd4LtHpCHUkM9zWUCo\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"120\" width=\"240\" style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/zQbRnK2jZhEO5MtLMaB7kZWH2HGyU7pfdmnj8146_Gxxr9TB4r7n0jgnjMpRBPXm7vsKzZ3CIPVG0kBoQ7sQKFajdKzn9NNmxzYsdDyN_L7gu7eBukYJMxEoItZLU2mVp_YY52frGgpE3ff8UlXMJty81L8mnqbhzgcUNUzZD3Va5R2GFLnAf3s3esebGmcwi2MK9W05sfkVovGcYL1Iq3S0mbg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://opengraph.githubassets.com/1dbe8728f86b58ccaf2c7b445267c6eabcbf201ac2bfcfe5b48b7bc197360b89/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185#issuecomment-455866010\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs/issues/185%23issuecomment-455866010&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471958783000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LGFvd4LtHpCHUkM9zWUCo\">Problem\r\n running CDS analysis engine: `C:\\\\PROGRA~2\\\\Distance` is not recognized as an internal or external command · Issue #185 · DistanceDevelopment/distance-bugs</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">\r\nTrying to do data analyses for any sample data set, I got the log: Initializing Making Data File Making Data Selection Queries Making Input File Engine started with the following command: C:\\\\PROGRA...</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(166,166,166)\">\r\n<a href=\"http://github.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://github.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471958783000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2uuJmbsLpXCUrs_XmF1TxY\">github.com</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nYou need not partition your hard disk or anything so dramatic. Simply install Distance for Windows into a directory on your hard disk with no spaces. For example, when asked where to install the software, simply reply &quot;C:/Distance7&quot;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nLet us know if that solves your problem.<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b